# The fifteen sub-projects are deliberately NOT listed here. Each is its own
# independent git repo with its own history, and its files are versioned there
# and never here — the parent tracks each one as a submodule (ADR-031), so it
# records a gitlink (a pinned commit SHA) and nothing else. Ignoring those paths
# would make `git submodule add` refuse them.
# See "This directory is the parent workspace" in CLAUDE.md.

# Not a repo and not a service — the empty directory the resource services write
# uploads into (docs/workflow.md §Repo layout). Without this line an upload made
# in local dev shows up as untracked here.
/BEs/dev/upload-local/

/.idea/

# Secrets never enter this repo — the parent ignores these exactly as every
# sub-repo does. `env` (no dot) is the committed placeholder template and stays
# tracked.
.env
.env.*
.envrc
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml
.netrc
*.pem
*.p12
id_rsa
id_ed25519

